        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 3:09PM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...NW wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 15 to 23 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI...NW wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 12 to 19 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...NW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 10 to 14 ft.
.SAT...NW wind up to 20 kt. Seas 7 to 11 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...NW wind 15 kt. Seas 7 ft.
.SUN THROUGH MON...W wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.TUE...E wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 3 to 8 ft.
</description>
